notes={2:'No drag coefficient/air density data supplied. Use an explicit empirical sphere-drag approximation and state uncertainty; no real slingshot trial or range measurement performed.',3:'Literal fixed floor pivot plus fixed-length rod touching one plane can preclude continued tip sliding; distinguish immediate unilateral detachment or corrected contact geometry. Nonuniform mass distribution is a parameter, not invented uniformity.',4:'Use ideal incompressible cross-section/plug-flow approximation and released outflow momentum. Source explicitly neglects viscosity/surface tension and outflow interference.',6:'Constant kinetic energy implies alpha=m*g dot v/v^2 with signed gravity vector; the force can add energy and is not ordinary passive drag. Stability is for that artificial supplied force.',7:'Actual H=sqrt((mu/m)*(px^2+py^2)*(1-(x^2+y^2)/a^2)). Formal H without canonical equations differs from explicit Newton mass-spring energy in 2000 Q34.',8:'Prism length, orientation/contact face and axial-wave versus local contact compliance not specified. No experiment performed. Scalar Young modulus inference requires a declared aligned long-rod approximation.',10:'No empirical day-length/tidal torque number given. State a measured/estimated torque or lag parameter; do not pretend material response and precise annual recession are fixed by dimensional constants alone.',11:'Mixer angular speed and bulk-fluid rotation are not automatically equal. Parabolic equilibrium assumes steady solid-body liquid rotation; exact stationary-wall mixer hydrodynamics not determined by given omega alone.',13:'Actual dipoles form a T on a rigid ruler. Account for forces and lever-arm moments as well as local m cross B torques before asserting net self-rotation.',14:'Determine identifiability from accessible nodes and test excitations; exact parallel branches can be indistinguishable. No fabricated meter readings.',15:'Hidden intermediate conductor charge can store inaccessible electrostatic energy even when external voltage is zero. Capacitances and allowed node access must be parameterized.',16:'Electromagnetic field angular momentum is per unit length for an infinite rod; include both E and axial B with consistent signs. Do not assert a physical negative-inertia perpetual wheel.',18:'All a-d one top-level task. Adiabatic uniform ideal-gas/quasistatic internal-state approximation and pressure-step kinetic-energy handling should be explicit; entropy includes final environment heat.',19:'Small v does not itself supply moving blackbody intensity/aberration or emission momentum. No exact radiation-frame law printed; actual disk material/heat capacities unspecified.',20:'No coin-drop experiment performed. Ballistic rigid motion is not automatically chaotic; finite-height fairness and a positive Lyapunov exponent are hypotheses to test, not fabricated observations.',21:'Random-walk increment law, random-time distribution and broker count are unspecified. Parameterize them; additive prices can cross zero unless a model/cutoff is declared. Historical math exercise, not investment advice.',22:'Actual heavy-tail piecewise text uses Hungarian ha (=if). x between 0 and 1 implies large-M waiting-time ageing, with finite-M cutoff limits distinct. Exponential escape density must be normalized; all reset rules supplied.',23:'Actual PDE is (Laplacian+k^2)psi=U psi. Outgoing/radiation condition selected by the stated leading form. Higher terms give finite-radius/angular wave structure; no Born cross-section calculation demanded.',24:'Airy definition integral lacks the conventional 1/pi normalization, which changes amplitude only. No time-dependent Schrodinger PDE written; do not import it as if supplied.',27:'Finite angular stencil needs a boundary/interpolation prescription on the cubic grid. L2 spectra and coordinate derivative commutators can be computed mathematically; spin extra is not assumed an operational quantum model.',30:'Actual map is |0> tensor(alpha,beta) to |0> tensor(alpha,0)+|1> tensor(0,beta). This fixes a state-map action but not quantum generator, Pauli components or density-operator postulates.',33:'Homogeneous spherical Earth and gravity-only ideal tunnel are source assumptions; rotation/air friction ignored explicitly. Endpoints and geographic separation remain parameters if not supplied.',34:'All fatigue/performance laws supplied, including possibility of negative efficiency. This is toy optimization, not an empirical human productivity/health claim.'}
